2. **Explore new territory**: The data suggests that lower polymer_wt (17–17.5) with moderate bath_temp (10–15°C), N2=True, moderate wait times, and mixing_temp ~65°C tends to give good results. The high variability in 17p5-15deg-60s-N2 may be partly due to environmental conditions (coupon humidity varied dramatically: 7.75, 7.79, 7.81 — very low, suggesting a dry environment that could affect skin formation).

