- 17p5-10deg-15s-N2 run1: E=709, PF=0.28 (but run2 gave E=475, PF=0.33)

The **17p5-10deg-15s-N2** condition (mixing_temp=65, bath_temp=10, pullcast_speed=6, N2=True, wait=15s, nips=1800s, polymer_wt=17.5) has three runs:
